@startuml
title Analise Dinamica - Sequencia resumida

autonumber
actor "Utilizador" as U
participant "Frontend React" as FE
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Jobs de Analise" as JOBS
participant "Orquestrador de VM" as VMO
participant "Driver de VM" as DRV
participant "Agente de VM" as AGENT
database "Armazenamento de Jobs" as DB

U -> FE: Carregar ficheiro + escolher dinamica
FE -> API: POST /api/analysis?analysis_type=dynamic
API -> JOBS: create_job(file,dynamic)
JOBS -> DB: Registar job (queued/running)
JOBS -> VMO: Executar analise dinamica
VMO -> DRV: Escolher e executar driver

alt Driver real (Hyper-V/Proxmox)
DRV -> AGENT: Upload, execucao e recolha de relatorio
AGENT --> DRV: Comportamento observado
else Driver stub
DRV --> VMO: Comportamento sintetico
end

VMO --> JOBS: Resultado dinamico
JOBS -> DB: Guardar resultado e estado final

loop Polling do frontend
FE -> API: GET /api/analysis/{jobId}
API -> DB: Ler estado e resultado do job
API --> FE: Estado + dynamicResult
end

FE --> U: Mostrar resumo comportamental e detalhes dinamicos

@enduml
